    <bpmn:process id="W_W63" name="W63. Shelf Label &amp; Price Tag Distribution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Price change batch approved (W40 step 5) or promotional pricing approved (W13 step 3)
Frequency: Price changes: ~2–3 batches/week; Promotional: 6 major events/year + 12 monthly hot deals
Volume: ~20–50 SKUs per price change batch (reconciling to the ~200–500 SRP changes/month canon per W40) × 200 stores = ~4,000–10,000 shelf labels per batch; promotional batches may be larger
Owner: Pricing Analyst (generation); Store Manager (execution)
Participants: Pricing Analyst, IT, Store Manager, Department Supervisors, Stock Associates
Source: workflow W63 — Shelf Label &amp; Price Tag Distribution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W63_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W63_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W63_Lane2" name="Stock Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W63_Lane3" name="Dept. Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W63_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W63_Start5" name="Price change batch approved (W40 step 5) or promotional pricing approved (W13 step 3)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W63_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W63_Task6" name="After price change approval (W40 step 5) or promo approval (W13 step 3), system…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: After price change approval (W40 step 5) or promo approval (W13 step 3), system generates shelf label print file: SKU, old price, new price, effective date, store assignment, aisle/shelf location (if location master populated)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W63_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W63_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W63_Task7" name="System transmits print file to centralized label printer at HQ or to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System transmits print file to centralized label printer at HQ or to store-level label printers (if equipped); labels printed per store with store identifier, SKU barcode, item description, and new SRP
Responsible (R): System / IT
Accountable (A): IT Team
Duration: 15–30 min/batch (centralized) or 10 min/store (local)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W63_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W63_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W63_Task8" name="If centralized printing: HQ packages labels by store; ships to stores via next…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: If centralized printing: HQ packages labels by store; ships to stores via next available DC delivery truck (W4) with clear labeling by department and effective date
Responsible (R): Stock Associate (HQ)
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 1–2 hours/batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W63_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W63_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W63_Task9" name="Store Manager or Dept. Supervisor receives labels; sorts by department; assigns…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Store Manager or Dept. Supervisor receives labels; sorts by department; assigns Stock Associates to apply labels before store opening on effective date
Responsible (R): Dept. Supervisor
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W63_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W63_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W63_Task10" name="Stock Associates walk aisles with label batch; match labels to shelf items by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Stock Associates walk aisles with label batch; match labels to shelf items by barcode or location; replace old labels with new; remove old labels from shelf edge
Responsible (R): Stock Associate
Accountable (A): Dept. Supervisor
Duration: 30–60 min/batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W63_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W63_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W63_Task11" name="Department Supervisor spot-checks label accuracy on effective date: scan 10–20…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Department Supervisor spot-checks label accuracy on effective date: scan 10–20 random items per department with RF gun; verify displayed price matches system price
Responsible (R): Dept. Supervisor
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W63_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W63_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W63_Task12" name="If discrepancy found: Dept. Supervisor immediately corrects label and reports…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: If discrepancy found: Dept. Supervisor immediately corrects label and reports root cause (missed label in batch, wrong location, system vs. print mismatch)
Responsible (R): Dept. Supervisor
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5 min/correction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W63_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W63_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W63_Task13" name="For electronic shelf labels (ESL) — if deployed at select stores: system pushes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: For electronic shelf labels (ESL) — if deployed at select stores: system pushes price changes to ESL devices overnight; Dept. Supervisor verifies ESL display matches system price during opening walkthrough (W5A step 2); no physical label handling required
Responsible (R): System / Dept. Supervisor
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated + 5 min verification</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W63_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W63_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W63_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W63_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-241 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing &amp; Promotions (PA-01.2).) | - operational: Pricing Analyst (generation); Store Manager (execution) review and approval gate
Owner: Pricing Analyst (generation); Store Manager (execution)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
