    <bpmn:process id="W_W678" name="W678. Multi-Channel Pricing Consistency Monitoring &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily price consistency check; price change activation events
Frequency: Daily automated scan; weekly exception review; monthly governance report
Volume: 35,000 active SKUs priced across 5+ channels: POS (200 stores), ecommerce website, mobile app, marketplace (Lazada/Shopee), wholesale price list, trade account pricing
Owner: Pricing Analyst
Participants: Category Manager, Ecommerce Manager, Digital Marketing Manager, Store Operations Manager
Source: workflow W678 — Multi-Channel Pricing Consistency Monitoring &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W678_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W678_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W678_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W678_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W678_Lane2" name="Pricing Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W678_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W678_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W678_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W678_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W678_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W678_Lane3" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W678_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W678_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W678_Start5" name="Daily price consistency check; price change activation events">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W678_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W678_Task6" name="System performs overnight price consistency scan across all channels: compares…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System performs overnight price consistency scan across all channels: compares POS price master, ecommerce price feed, marketplace API prices, wholesale price list, and promotional prices for all active SKUs; flags any SKU where channel prices differ beyond configured tolerance (default: 0 for SRP items, 2% for promotional items)
Responsible (R): System (automated)
Accountable (A): Pricing Analyst
Duration: Overnight</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W678_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W678_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W678_Task7" name="Pricing Analyst reviews consistency exceptions: categorizes as intentional…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Pricing Analyst reviews consistency exceptions: categorizes as intentional (channel-specific promo, marketplace-exclusive pricing, wholesale tier discount) or unintentional (sync failure, stale cache, manual override error)
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W678_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W678_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W678_Task8" name="For unintentional discrepancies: Pricing Analyst identifies root cause (price…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For unintentional discrepancies: Pricing Analyst identifies root cause (price push failure per W533, marketplace feed lag, ecommerce cache issue, manual POS override not synced); triggers correction with responsible team (IT for sync issues, Ecommerce Manager for marketplace, Store Operations for POS)
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Manager / Store Operations Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W678_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W678_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W678_Task9" name="Pricing Analyst validates promotional price consistency: ensures current…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Pricing Analyst validates promotional price consistency: ensures current promotions per W13 are reflected identically across POS, ecommerce, and marketplace; verifies DTI price freeze per POS-024 is applied across all channels simultaneously
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W678_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W678_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W678_Task10" name="Weekly: Pricing Analyst produces exception report for Category Manager…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Weekly: Pricing Analyst produces exception report for Category Manager: inconsistency count by channel, root cause distribution, time-to-resolution, recurring issues
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W678_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W678_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W678_Task11" name="Monthly: Pricing Analyst produces pricing consistency governance report for VP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Monthly: Pricing Analyst produces pricing consistency governance report for VP Merchandising: channel compliance rate (target ≥ 99%), revenue impact of pricing inconsistencies (customer complaints, margin leakage, DTI compliance risk), recommended process improvements
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W678_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W678_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W678_Task12" name="Quarterly: VP Merchandising reviews multi-channel pricing strategy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Quarterly: VP Merchandising reviews multi-channel pricing strategy: channel-specific pricing authorization, competitive positioning per W130, and margin floor enforcement per category
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W678_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W678_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W678_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W678_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-241 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing &amp; Promotions (PA-01.2).) | - operational: Pricing Analyst review and approval gate
Owner: Pricing Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
