        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-241 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing &amp; Promotions (PA-01.2).) | - operational: Trade Marketing Manager review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Trade Marketing Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
