    <bpmn:process id="W_W1278" name="W1278. Store-Level Competitor Price Monitoring &amp; Market Intelligence Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Weekly competitor price monitoring cycle; or ad-hoc competitor promotional event detected
Frequency: Weekly per store; consolidated monthly at HQ
Volume: ~25–30 competitor price observations per store per week; ~5,000–6,000 chain-wide
Owner: Pricing Analyst
Participants: Department Supervisors, Pricing Analyst, Category Manager, VP Merchandising
Source: workflow W1278 — Store-Level Competitor Price Monitoring &amp; Market Intelligence Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1278_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1278_Lane1" name="Department Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1278_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1278_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1278_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1278_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1278_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1278_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1278_Lane3" name="Pricing Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1278_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1278_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1278_Lane4" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1278_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1278_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1278_Start6" name="Weekly competitor price monitoring cycle; or ad-hoc competitor promotional event detected">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1278_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1278_Task7" name="Competitor identification per store">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Competitor identification per store: Each Department Supervisor maintains a list of 3–5 key local competitors within 5 km radius; competitor profile includes: store name, format (big-box vs. talipapa vs. specialty), key overlapping categories, and general pricing positioning (discount vs. premium)
Responsible (R): Department Supervisor
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 1 hour/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1278_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1278_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1278_Task8" name="Weekly price observation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Weekly price observation: Department Supervisors observe competitor shelf prices or promotional flyers for a rotating category list assigned by Pricing Analyst (e.g., Week 1: cement &amp; lumber, Week 2: paint &amp; electrical, Week 3: tools &amp; hardware); record 25–30 key item prices via mobile app with photo evidence where possible
Responsible (R): Department Supervisor
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 30 min/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1278_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1278_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1278_Task9" name="Mobile app data submission">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Mobile app data submission: Department Supervisor enters competitor prices into the Competitor Price Intelligence mobile app: (a) select competitor, (b) scan or manually enter BuildRight SKU, (c) enter competitor price, (d) note promotional context (regular, sale, clearance), (e) attach photo if available; data synced to central pricing database
Responsible (R): Department Supervisor
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 20 min/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1278_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1278_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1278_Task10" name="Automated competitive analysis">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Automated competitive analysis: System matches competitor prices against BuildRight current SRP: (a) calculates price gap (% above/below BuildRight), (b) flags items where BuildRight is &gt;10% above competitor (price risk), (c) flags items where BuildRight is &gt;20% below competitor (margin opportunity), (d) generates competitive positioning heatmap by region and category
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Pricing Analyst
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1278_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1278_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1278_Task11" name="Weekly price intelligence report">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Weekly price intelligence report: Pricing Analyst reviews system-generated competitive analysis: (a) identifies categories where BuildRight is losing on price in specific regions, (b) identifies categories where BuildRight can increase price without competitive risk, (c) drafts price adjustment recommendations with margin impact estimate, (d) presents to Category Manager
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 3 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1278_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1278_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1278_Task12" name="Price action decisions">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Price action decisions: Category Manager reviews recommendations and decides: (a) match competitor price (markdown per W93), (b) maintain current price with value proposition differentiation (brand, service, availability), (c) adjust trade pricing for B2B accounts in affected region per W112, (d) trigger promotional response per W262; VP Merchandising approves changes above PHP 50,000 impact per SKU
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1278_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1278_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1278_Task13" name="Monthly market intelligence briefing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly market intelligence briefing: Pricing Analyst compiles monthly competitive landscape report for VP Merchandising: (a) competitor expansion activity (new store openings, renovations), (b) category-level price trends, (c) emerging local competitors, (d) vendor-exclusive deals observed at competitors; feeds into quarterly category strategy review per W1
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1278_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1278_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1278_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1278_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-241 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing &amp; Promotions (PA-01.2).) | - operational: Pricing Analyst review and approval gate
Owner: Pricing Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
